openPosition.t.sol
├── when token is not an allowed token
│   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__TOKEN_NOT_ALLOWED} error
└── when token is an allowed token
    ├── when collateral is less than or equal to computed position fee
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__INSUFFICIENT_COLLATERAL} error
    └── when collateral is greater than computed position fee
        ├── when resulting position is liquidatable
        │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__LIQUIDATABLE_POSITION} error
        └── when resulting position is not liquidatable
            ├── it should create a new position with expected values
            ├── it should increase total open interest for token and side
            ├── it should emit the {PositionOpened} event
            ├── it should call {reserveAssets} on pool with expected assets amount
            ├── it should transfer the computed position fee from user to pool
            └── it should transfer net collateral from user to perpex
